# ── Biometric data policy ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Session logs and raw recordings stay local. Self-experiment data MAY be included by
# explicit per-case decision (e.g. supporting a publication) — this is a judgement call,
# not a ban. What does NOT belong here regardless: device serials and BLE addresses
# (persistent identifiers), and session logs (intimate). This repo is PUBLIC and git
# history is permanent. Derived and aggregate statistics doing evidentiary work are
# fine and belong here.
tests/fixtures/muse_athena/*.jsonl
tests/fixtures/muse_athena/*.npz
tests/fixtures/**/*_eeg.jsonl
